{"assets": [], "headings": [{"pk": 0, "elem": "<h1>General Remarks</h1>", "level": "h1", "text": "General Remarks", "target": ""}, {"pk": 1, "elem": "<h2>Manuscript Submission</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "Manuscript Submission", "target": ""}, {"pk": 2, "elem": "<h2>File Formats</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "File Formats", "target": ""}, {"pk": 3, "elem": "<h2>Submission Structure</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "Submission Structure", "target": ""}, {"pk": 4, "elem": "<h2>File Naming Conventions</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "File Naming Conventions", "target": ""}, {"pk": 5, "elem": "<h2>Obtaining Usage Rights</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "Obtaining Usage Rights", "target": ""}, {"pk": 6, "elem": "<h2>Uniform Formatting</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "Uniform Formatting", "target": ""}, {"pk": 7, "elem": "<h2>Please Avoid the Following</h2>", "level": "h2", "text": "Please Avoid the Following", "target": ""}], "refs": [{"pk": 0, "target_id": "", "text": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_string": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "elem": "<p>To help you with compilation of your manuscript, we offer the manuscript template. The template is compatible with Word 2007 or higher and contains basic style formats that fulfill our requirements with respect to structure, typography, and layout.  To get the newest manuscript template, please send a request to <a href=\"mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu\">tnb.admin@uni.lu</a>.</p>"}, {"pk": 1, "target_id": "", "text": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_string": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "elem": "<li>Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu\">tnb.admin@uni.lu</a>, stating all appropriate data about the book:<ol><li>title of the book,</li><li>list of authors,</li><li>short description (optional),</li><li>slug proposal (unique identifier which will appear in the book URL),</li><li>list of files sorted by order in which they should appear in the book.</li></ol></li>"}, {"pk": 2, "target_id": "", "text": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_string": "tnb.admin@uni.lu", "prev_href": "mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu", "elem": "<p>To obtain the form, write an email to <a id=\"_Hlk169600819\"></a><a href=\"mailto:tnb.admin@uni.lu\">tnb.admin@uni.lu</a>.</p>"}], "targets": [], "substitutions": [], "citation_groups": [], "citation_items": []}